  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-CHATWOOT-SYNC v2\n\n**Cambios vs v1:**\n- Verifica lead_memory antes de crear contacto/conv\n- Reutiliza conv activa si existe (open/pending)\n- Llama a upsert_lead_memory_chatwoot_ids()\n- Nunca crea conv duplicada para el mismo lead\n\n**Cred PG:** Supabase VPS (bpXsDuBulR5Lk1Yf)\n**Cred HTTP:** Chatwoot API (i5ezyRiVmSifQ3el)\n**Pre-req:** Migraciones V26–V28 aplicadas",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-v2-001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -112,
        -16
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SET search_path TO sales_prod, public, extensions;\nSELECT\n  c.id AS conv_id,\n  lq.nombre_cliente AS nombre,\n  lq.telefono_1     AS telefono,\n  c.marca,\n  lq.modelo,\n  lq.quicklink_id::text AS quicklink_id,\n  COALESCE(cm.chatwoot_inbox_id, 2) AS inbox_id,\n  -- Datos de lead_memory para evitar conversaciones duplicadas\n  lm.chatwoot_contact_id AS lm_contact_id,\n  lm.chatwoot_conv_id    AS lm_conv_id,\n  lm.phone               AS lm_phone\nFROM conversaciones c\nJOIN  leads_quicklink lq ON lq.id = c.lead_id\nLEFT JOIN configuracion_marcas cm ON cm.marca = c.marca\nLEFT JOIN lead_memory lm ON lm.conversation_id = c.id\nWHERE c.chatwoot_contact_id IS NULL\n  AND c.chatwoot_conv_id IS NULL\n  AND c.estado NOT IN ('NEW_LEAD','WON','LOST','NOT_CONTACTABLE','DISCARDED')\nORDER BY c.created_at ASC\nLIMIT 50",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pg-v2-pending",
      "name": "PG - Get Pending Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
